[{"title":"一犁春雨图","author":"何异","text":"负郭先畴二顷馀，饱看雨后著耕夫。\n软红尘里家山梦，却就君家阅画图。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41200,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"玉笥山邓仙","author":"何异","text":"有怀霁月光风度，出宰青山绿水乡。\n羽檄交驰公事了，一铺真画一炉香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41201,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"钟山寺","author":"何异","text":"贰卿追绿野，一壑饱清泉。\n诗到永嘉上，山如灵隐前。\n生涯归古寺，遗照对枯禅。\n二百馀年话，来同三月天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41202,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"章少机建小阁用陈伯强韵","author":"何异","text":"楼居草草假三间，便觉星辰手可攀。\n最喜坐中先得月，不妨睡处也看山。\n林疏啼鸟秋弹曲，天阔飞鸿晓捲班。\n对镜清吟无限好，典衣冷债几时还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41203,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题李国博东园","author":"何异","text":"东园吟思玉蟾清，园客开门古意生。\n冰砚云灯深洞宇，春花秋草旧宫城。\n人藏密树寻声见，鹭下寒池照影惊。\n三十分司泉石主，马蹄尘外得闻名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41204,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题环翠阁","author":"何异","text":"环翠阁边无点埃，尽收清致助吟才。\n溪头月落渔烟散，岸口城低野色来。\n斜槛半依秋树出，小窗知为北山开。\n沙禽古水閒相趁，误入疏帘静却回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41205,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"大华山","author":"何异","text":"地灵推宝盖，奇崛跨三州。\n帝座联枢极，星躔值斗牛。\n江南誇绝胜，仙伯揖浮邱。\n旧观依山脚，崇坛冠岭头。\n怀哉二真意，特地一时留。\n争谓神丹熟，谁知瑞气浮。\n妄传异人气，遽遣老臣收。\n云外尝交战，风前枉运筹。\n利锋皆瓦砾，勇锐失貔貅。\n敛帜惊逋伏，还兵敢逗遛。\n桂司归内府，芝检动前旒。\n遗镞砮牙细，缠滩马迹稠。\n一承丹凰诏，双拥翠云裘。\n功满三千行，神参八极游。\n后先鸾与鹤，乘跨虎兼虬。\n仙乐宣新响，文枰化故楸。\n玄坛开豁敞，紫洞锁深幽。\n鸡豢馀空窦，龙投按旧湫。\n斩妖留血树，化石望仙舟。\n鹅垍晴飞雪，茶凹暑挟秋。\n退心披峻岭，净手掬寒流。\n石锐矛头似，山长剑脊侔。\n路危行九曲，台险过三休。\n灵药从人乞，薰炉足意谋。\n三庐腾瑞相，五岳记真游。\n雷电归驱使，云天托庇庥。\n遗踪难纪载，著句欠旁搜。\n四万八千岁，五城十二楼。\n近疑连绛阙，远想接沧洲。\n招隐仙翁意，吾簪此可投。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41206,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"安源院","author":"何异","text":"施田乐贰卿，读书吴吏部。\n石迹犹可寻，青山亦如故。\n春深笋蕨香，岁熟仓箱富。\n坐久遂忘归，更问钟山路。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41207,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宗老堂","author":"何异","text":"岿然独存灵光殿，再世袭封康乐公。\n此堂宗老正类此，尽在相传衣钵中。\n佳人一笑粲玉齿，愿公寿考仍欢喜。\n子如父，父如子，灯灯接续无穷已。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41208,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"浮石山庄","author":"何异","text":"天巧不易觑，觑巧不难著。\n狐裘或反衣，铸铁真成错。\n此亭对此石，层层水初落。\n凭高得其要，他景皆可略。\n苍波绕庐阜，白浪萦衡霍。\n鱼龙出变怪，鳞鬣纷拿攫。\n初疑海上来，根株相连络。\n又疑泗滨渡，清润可磨琢。\n水石两奇特，宾主一笑乐。\n犹想岘山亭，清名与山托。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41209,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"高峰山","author":"何异","text":"快登十里坛，望极千里眼。\n天近风转清，地高日难晚。\n禽声自圆熟，山色真平远。\n再来除荆棘，踏月归路稳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41210,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"控巴台 其一","author":"何异","text":"阅武弓刀劲利，留宾歌舞清妍。\n红映连樯灯火，翠浮隔岸人烟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41211,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"控巴台 其二","author":"何异","text":"台上小留归客，台前稳系扁舟。\n三宿翠微阁上，一程白帝城头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41212,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题奣岩","author":"何扬祖","text":"石室何时霹雳开，曾听绣斧凯歌回。\n谁知二百馀年后，复有旌旗笳鼓来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41213,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题范宽临流独坐图","author":"何权","text":"茅堂结构背江干，日日爱看江上山。\n箕踞盘陀吟未稳，不知身在画图间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41214,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元旦","author":"何汝樵","text":"腊尽寒犹厉，春来雪未乾。\n流年怜易失，为客敢求安。\n故里屠苏酒，新年柏叶盘。\n嗟哉老兄弟，谁与共清欢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41215,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"留题灵岩","author":"何约","text":"天下名蓝称四绝，灵岩雄与岱山连。\n古渊堂上凭栏处，似在栖岩太华边。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41216,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"何舟","text":"鲁望隐时曾为钓，季鹰归日已成名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41217,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"何舟","text":"野市人烟归落日，渔家风景占高秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41218,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"龙泉观","author":"何行","text":"蓬莱境界隔风烟，一带银河接九天。\n礼斗瑶台春草合，豢龙石钵玉沙圆。\n红云几片危楼上，古木千寻落照边。\n惆怅仙人何处去，空馀月色满山川。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41219,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽薛艮斋","author":"何伯谨","text":"剀切忧时论，慈祥济物心。\n贾生年尚少，平子虑何深。\n徒抱经纶志，俄闻讣告音。\n朔风传薤挽，谁不泪沾襟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41220,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"浣溪沙","author":"何作善","text":"草草杯盘访玉人。\n灯花呈喜座添春。\n邀郎觅句要奇新。\n黛浅波娇情脉脉，云轻柳弱意真真。\n从今风月属闲人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41221,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游天柱宫因留宿观醮","author":"何君式","text":"路转峰回意豁然，逢迎马首更飞泉。\n地严九锁红尘外，天近三关黄道边。\n奏简夜腾孤鹤表，步虚声彻老龙渊。\n会须香火通仙籍，一洗人间未了缘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41222,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"六和塔","author":"何宋英","text":"吴国山迎越国山，江流吴越两山间。\n两山相对各无语，江自奔波山自閒。\n风帆烟棹知多少，东去西来何日了。\n江潮淘尽古今人，只有青山长不老。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41223,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"述怀","author":"何宏中","text":"马革盛尸每恨迟，西山饿踣更何辞。\n姓名不到中兴历，付与皇天后土知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41224,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送乐安教谕周亦山 其二","author":"何希之","text":"垂晚相携手，飞谈入理微。\n前修推大雅，晚辈际真依。\n君去纡朱绂，吾将老布衣。\n相敦各千载，别泪不须挥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41225,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送乐安教谕周亦山 其一","author":"何希之","text":"独佩传家印，芹宫一线春。\n居然风月意，笑却簿书尘。\n溪水吾同味，檐花道固贫。\n迂寒从献笑，肯与俗为邻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41226,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"何希之","text":"诸公错落阳和调，赢得林间自在翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41227,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"小园","author":"何应龙","text":"地占方方十丈宽，巳栽花木四时看。\n客来莫笑生涯薄，窗外新添竹数竿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41228,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元夕戏题","author":"何应龙","text":"从教香月转亭西，贪看灯毬忘却归。\n挨得玉梅零落尽，蛾儿犹傍鬓边飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41229,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"无愁","author":"何应龙","text":"世间惟我最无愁，才是无愁得自由。\n午睡觉来门半掩，一池春水看鱼游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41230,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"木犀","author":"何应龙","text":"露粟藏金一半开，层层碧玉映楼台。\n西风昨夜吹香过，人在栏干待月来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41231,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"见梅","author":"何应龙","text":"云绕前冈水绕村，忽惊空谷有佳人。\n天寒日暮吹香去，尽是冰霜不是春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41232,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东风","author":"何应龙","text":"和彻诗篇得暂闲，落梅香里立栏干。\n新裁白纻春衫薄，犹怯东风一阵寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41233,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"写情","author":"何应龙","text":"洒泪题春墨晕乾，东风无便寄郎难。\n青箱再展笺云看，蠹却相思字不完。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41234,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"伤春","author":"何应龙","text":"荷叶初浮水上钱，柳花飘尽岸头绵。\n不知春色归何处，欲向空山问杜鹃。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41235,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"有别","author":"何应龙","text":"楼上佳人唱渭城，楼前杨柳识离情。\n一声未是难听处，最是难听第四声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41236,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"有所思","author":"何应龙","text":"曾倚空屏唱柳枝，一声娇逐暮云低。\n重来只见流莺在，立尽斜阳不肯啼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41237,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"江上有感","author":"何应龙","text":"江上秋深客未归，荻花枫叶两依依。\n伤心最是长桥路，落日西风一雁飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41238,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"老翁","author":"何应龙","text":"八十昂藏一老翁，得钱长是醉春风。\n杏花村酒家家好，莫向桥边问牧童。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41239,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"舟中偶成","author":"何应龙","text":"黄帽招呼急下船，天明仅可过涵山。\n朦朦一枕梅花梦，犹在寒窗纸帐间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41240,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"芍药","author":"何应龙","text":"金蕊丝头茜染成，五云楼映玉盘倾。\n谢郎一入中书后，二十四桥空月明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41241,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"行人","author":"何应龙","text":"柳花吹断晚寒轻，草色拖裙罨岸青。\n解识行人今古恨，路边惟有短长亭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41242,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过垂虹","author":"何应龙","text":"垂虹桥下水连天，一带青山落照边。\n三十六陂烟浦冷，鹭鸶飞上钓渔船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41243,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吴蚕","author":"何应龙","text":"正是吴蚕出火时，交交窗外一禽啼。\n溪西有叶高难采，遥见青裙上竹梯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41244,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杜鹃","author":"何应龙","text":"君若思归可便归，故乡祇在锦江西。\n不知何事留君住，却向空山日夜啼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41245,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"居家","author":"何应龙","text":"居家到底胜居官，啼鸟声中昼掩关。\n待得小园花落尽，更须移酒对青山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41246,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"帘","author":"何应龙","text":"半窣香波护曲栏，缬花红映玉钩闲。\n晓来几阵轻风过，时见溪南罨画山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41247,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"采莲曲","author":"何应龙","text":"采莲时节懒匀妆，日到波心拨棹忙。\n莫向荷花深处去，荷花深处有鸳鸯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41248,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"客怀","author":"何应龙","text":"客怀处处不宜秋，秋到梧桐动客愁。\n想得故人无字到，雁声远过夕阳楼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41249,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春阴","author":"何应龙","text":"密雨流酥入翠苔，春阴日日锁楼台。\n女郎未有寻芳约，辜负樱桃一半开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41250,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春词","author":"何应龙","text":"玉纤轻揭绣帘开，行到花前泪满腮。\n正尔春心无处托，一双胡蝶忽飞来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41251,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春寒","author":"何应龙","text":"博山熏尽鹧鸪斑，罗带同心不忍看。\n莫近栏干听花雨，楼高无处着春寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41252,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"活计","author":"何应龙","text":"三间茅屋盖头颅，除却吟篇事事无。\n拟把十年穷活计，一时倾倒向江湖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41253,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"盆中四时木犀","author":"何应龙","text":"一树婆娑月里栽，是谁移种下天来。\n金英恰似清霄月，一度圆时一度开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41254,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"相思","author":"何应龙","text":"二月春风杨柳青，闻郎系马到长亭。\n相思情味如中酒，折尽梨花嗅不醒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41255,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夏日即事","author":"何应龙","text":"野土生烟草树焦，彤彤日脚火云烧。\n池边自拗青荷叶，分付山童盖药苗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41256,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"效无题体","author":"何应龙","text":"玉钗风断扇云深，砌冷帘空月易沉。\n流水落花无处问，一年春事一年心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41257,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"效香奁体","author":"何应龙","text":"云幕重重雨未收，嫩寒先到玉帘钩。\n一杯晚酒无人共，羞带双花下小楼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41258,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"旅中示同辈","author":"何应龙","text":"与君同出已多时，费尽囊金典尽衣。\n只待春江烟浪暖，小舟先趁白鸥归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41259,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晓窗","author":"何应龙","text":"桃花落尽李花残，女伴相期看牡丹。\n二十四番花信后，晓窗犹带几分寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41260,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"柴门","author":"何应龙","text":"何必逢人尽说贫，自来求己胜求人。\n梅花落尽青山远，深掩柴门过一春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41261,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"笋","author":"何应龙","text":"泥中莫怪出头迟，历尽冰霜祇自知。\n昨夜震雷轰渭亩，请君来看化龙枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41262,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"粉蝶","author":"何应龙","text":"宿粉栖香乐最深，暂依芳草避春禽。\n晚来风起还无定，舞入梨花何处寻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41263,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄胡雪江","author":"何应龙","text":"借得官亭小似船，六桥风月友三贤。\n芙蓉未发荷花老，一点诗情若个边。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41264,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"清明","author":"何应龙","text":"踏歌槌鼓近清明，小雨霏霏欲弄晴。\n唤起十年心上事，春风楼下卖花声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41265,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"清晓","author":"何应龙","text":"清晓轻传一信风，花添红粉草添茸。\n画楼十二栏干曲，春在珠帘第几重。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41266,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"腊梅","author":"何应龙","text":"晴日烘开小蜜房，紫檀心里认蜂黄。\n一冬不被风吹落，却讶江梅易断肠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41267,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"落花","author":"何应龙","text":"南浦云归春亦归，绿杨枝上鸟空啼。\n落花满地无人管，一半和香作燕泥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41268,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"碧桃","author":"何应龙","text":"玉仙同驾玉鸾飞，天上曾攀带露枝。\n一片不知何处落，晓来流到涌金池。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41269,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题临安僦楼","author":"何应龙","text":"过了烧灯望燕归，春寒刬地勒芳期。\n杏花深巷无人卖，细雨空帘尽日垂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41270,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题骆秀才葺故庐疏","author":"何应龙","text":"家在西湖合涧桥，短篱围得数椽茅。\n归来颇费支撑力，羞见春风燕子巢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41271,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠友人","author":"何应龙","text":"我向诗中为活计，君于酒里作生涯。\n世间乐事惟诗酒，各自风流占一家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41272,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"为客","author":"何应龙","text":"初秋为客暮秋归，一檐轻囊半是诗。\n试问客情何处恶，五更孤店酒醒时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41273,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"营道斋","author":"何弃仲","text":"儒行篇中有至论，书斋乡县两存存。\n南音楚国钟仪操，仁术函人孟氏言。\n近信每随流水到，旧庐凝望度云屯。\n里非胜母泉君子，循取佳名睹圣门。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41274,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]